<title>USA: Bowne &amp; Co current Q1 after gain $1.13/shr.</title>
<headline>Bowne &amp; Co current Q1 after gain $1.13/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOWNE &amp; CO., INC.</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statement of Earnings</p>
<p>			 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>				    First Quarter Ended January 31,</p>
<p>					1997			    1996</p>
<p> Net sales		$138,760,000		    $90,728,000</p>
<p>Income from operations</p>
<p>				13,907,000			5,390,000</p>
<p> Other income (A)	 35,733,000			  922,000</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  income taxes	    49,640,000			6,312,000</p>
<p> Income taxes	     21,095,000			2,719,000</p>
<p> Net income (A)	   28,545,000			3,593,000</p>
<p> Per share (A)		    1.61				.21</p>
<p> Average shares	   17,773,208		     17,483,271</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>Note A:  For the first quarter of FY97, other income includes the gain on the sale of Baseline of $35,273,000.  Net income includes $20,005,000 from this sale, which increased per share results by $1.13. SOURCE  Bowne &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
